INSERT INTO `case_studies` VALUES (1,'undefined','<p>The digital transformation of Grama Panchayats in Kerala marked a significant step in decentralized governance. Through effective implementation of service portals, asset registers, and grievance redressal systems, citizen interaction improved drastically.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 14:39:12','Y','','f17bd7ab-2206-49f0-8314-a6e43b182bab.pdf','Y',NULL,'digitizing-grama-panchayats-in-kerala-a-transformation-journey','da644ac4-baae-442e-9dad-f265cb9e45bf.jpg','Digitizing Grama Panchayats in Kerala: A Transformation Journey','2025-09-29 16:20:13',8),(2,'undefined','<p>Recognizing the access challenges in tribal belts, C-PART helped launch mobile administrative camps and multilingual grievance redressal cells, ensuring every voice is heard.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 14:41:39','Y','',NULL,'Y',NULL,'revamping-public-grievance-redressal-in-tribal-areas','826ba6ea-a9e3-4655-943d-683c27c5258b.jpg','Revamping Public Grievance Redressal in Tribal Areas','2025-09-30 14:59:06',13),(3,'undefined','<p>A data intelligence platform was deployed to monitor waste segregation, logistics, and citizen participation in waste reduction. The initiative led to improved accountability and efficient routing.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 14:44:54','Y','',NULL,'Y',NULL,'datadriven-decisionmaking-in-municipal-solid-waste-management','48cdacdc-1082-4dbc-87c4-5904f75ac2d5.jpg','Data-Driven Decision-Making in Municipal Solid Waste Management','2025-09-30 14:43:38',7),(4,'undefined','<p>C-PART facilitated the capacity building of women&#39;s SHGs to manage micro digital kiosks offering government and private services under one roof, creating sustainable income and empowerment.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 14:59:50','Y','','ceb36cf9-60cc-4205-8a12-11fafc597190.pdf','Y',NULL,'women-shgs-powering-panchayat-micro-enterprises','674f36bf-944c-4499-ba86-7d32df526cd0.jpg','Women SHGs Powering Panchayat Micro Enterprises','2025-09-29 12:47:40',2),(5,'undefined','<p>Partnering with local bodies and schools, a ward-level disaster plan was created and rehearsed to improve citizen preparedness and reduce panic during calamities.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 15:00:44','Y','','f7c09621-dc7c-4e78-9de5-fe627f4f43f8.pdf','Y',NULL,'strengthening-disaster-preparedness-at-ward-level','660672a5-c449-47cf-83f9-d82139ef972b.jpg','Strengthening Disaster Preparedness at Ward Level','2025-09-30 15:59:12',4),(6,'undefined','</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">Effectively overcoming challenges, we established a central database for better control over historical records. Our solution ensures data accuracy through checks, simplifies processes, and introduces an intuitive dashboard for real-time insights. We&#39;ve strengthened security, reduced latency, and streamlined report handling, making it easy to seek assistance. This has built an effective support system within the organization.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 15:01:28','Y','<div style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">KRAN Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution Provider with an exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector verticals in INDIA. Over the past 25 years, the focus has been on the Reinvention &amp; Transformation of the client addressing its pain areas and specific requirements. With a proven track record, KRAN has successfully worked with international agencies like ADB, WHO, World Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country. </span></p>\r\n','a5721c7f-030e-4c61-b324-9aeee28a9001.pdf','Y',NULL,'onestop-helpdesks-at-collectorates-a-citizencentric-reform','6bd6cd7a-e841-4b8b-9314-811924d5c4a0.jpg','One-Stop Helpdesks at Collectorates: A Citizen-Centric Reform','2025-09-30 15:50:15',8),(7,'undefined','<p>To promote participatory governance, open budget portals with infographics and simplified language were launched for Gram Panchayats to explain their annual plans to citizens.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 15:02:18','Y','','f25119ac-ae6c-46af-80b8-b6b92953b74c.pdf','Y',NULL,'-panchayat-budget-transparency-through-open-budget-portals','50cdc676-839b-45da-b1a8-773c8d8d41c7.jpg',' Panchayat Budget Transparency Through Open Budget Portals','2025-09-30 15:27:28',3),(8,'undefined','<p>A micro-credit support and space-allocation model was developed for informal vendors with digital onboarding, licenses, and basic training to ensure continuity and dignity of work.</p>\r\n','2025-07-17 15:03:05','N','','3a109bbf-2a87-496a-a554-481c8a7e5256.pdf',NULL,NULL,'rehabilitating-urban-street-vendors-postcovid','90e7af49-8baf-487d-9f5d-f03cfe387b41.jpg','Rehabilitating Urban Street Vendors Post-COVID','2025-09-30 14:49:01',0),(9,'Ajith',' Eco-friendly toilets with solar power and waste reuse features were constructed and managed by youth collectives, ensuring hygiene and employment.','2025-07-17 15:03:39','N','18 solar-powered units in tourist hotspots\r\n\r\nMonthly revenue generation of ₹8,000+\r\n\r\nLocal youth hired for operations and maintenance\r\n\r\nPartnered with tourism boards for promotion','266cc640-318a-4bc6-a278-e6dfbd007db6.pdf','N',NULL,'sustainable-public-toilets-with-community-engagement','d3f840fe-8867-4205-a484-15a8b9557ab6.jpg','Sustainable Public Toilets with Community Engagement','2025-09-29 12:46:44',3),(10,'Siva',' From changing printer defaults to placing eco-reminders near copiers, district offices saw a 30% drop in paper usage over six months through simple changes and awareness nudges.','2025-07-17 15:04:10','N','Reduced monthly paper usage from 15k to 9k sheets\r\n\r\nEco-reminder signage and digital workflows\r\n\r\nCost savings of ₹22,000 per district\r\n\r\nPlan to expand to Taluk offices','5b4a842e-2078-473f-8a70-aee7f4f32b96.pdf','N',NULL,'behavioral-nudges-to-reduce-paper-usage-in-offices','7c703d06-5b8d-4b03-ae6f-d1773eea7746.jpg','Behavioral Nudges to Reduce Paper Usage in Offices','2025-09-29 12:46:42',5),(11,'Syam Raj','<p>The <strong>Kerala e-Treasury system</strong> was implemented to digitize the complete cycle of government payments and collections. Prior to this system, citizens had to endure lengthy and inefficient processes involving manual challans, physical visits to treasury or banks, and delayed receipts. The new platform transformed this by enabling seamless online payments across departments for taxes, fees, and licenses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>e-Treasury allowed integration with multiple banking partners, enabling users to pay through internet banking, UPI, NEFT, or debit/credit cards. This eliminated delays in fund settlements and allowed real-time synchronization of transactions with government databases. Departments experienced fewer payment failures and quicker allocation of funds due to automated reconciliation processes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the administrative side, financial transparency was significantly enhanced, as every transaction could now be traced, audited, and monitored through digital records. The system also contributed to reducing the workload of treasury staff and minimizing errors in revenue reporting.</p>\r\n','2025-07-25 15:16:14','N','<p>? <strong>Citizen Benefits</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>24x7 online access to pay government dues</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Multi-mode payment support (UPI, net banking, cards)</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Instant receipt generation and challan download</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>? <strong>Government Efficiency</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Real-time transaction validation and auto-reconciliation</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Better cash flow visibility and accurate budgeting</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Reduced manual intervention and paperwork</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>? <strong>Digital Governance Outcomes</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Strengthened financial transparency and audit readiness</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Enhanced data accuracy and revenue collection</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Greater confidence in public financial systems</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','f6db2d67-83d4-4521-b42d-b9fb1a24ceb8.pdf','N',NULL,'etreasury-integration-with-government-payment-workflows','21b64096-3d23-4e76-91d4-5bd6a1ae0789.jpg','e-Treasury Integration with Government Payment Workflows','2025-09-29 12:46:40',1),(12,'Test','<p>Test</p>\r\n','2025-09-29 12:34:27','N','<p>Test</p>\r\n','06223176-e44c-4a03-b74e-fe49cc047b78.pdf','N',NULL,'test','8692cf5a-b715-4cde-a6dc-1efe3cf051e1.jpg','Test','2025-09-29 12:46:31',0);
