INSERT INTO `casestudy` VALUES (2,'Public Finance','Strengthening Decentralization: Digital Transformation Journey of Kerala State Audit Department','Audit- case study.jpg',NULL,'2023-08-17','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Audit department plays a vital role in ensuring transparency,\r\n    accountability within public sector organizations. They are responsible\r\n    for enhancing accountability of 3 tier panchayats, Municipal\r\n    Corporations, Municipalities, Other Local Funds and any other\r\n    institutions entrusted by Government of Kerala.\r\n    With a vision to promote excellence in Local Fund Audit towards\r\n    improving the quality of Governance in Local bodies and other\r\n    institutions audited by State Audit Department.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Before implementing the solution, the Audit Department has faced various\r\n    challenges that hindered their audit process. One of the key challenges\r\n    was the delay in tracking corrective actions. Without an efficient\r\n    system in place, it was difficult to monitor and ensure timely\r\n    implementation of necessary changes based on audit findings.\r\n    The department experienced high paperwork, which increased human errors\r\n    and impacted the objective of the audit flow. Moreover, there was a\r\n    lack of post-audit tracking, making it difficult to monitor the progress\r\n    and outcomes of completed audits. Addressing these challenges was\r\n    crucial to improving the efficiency, accuracy, and effectiveness of the\r\n    audit process.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">To enhance the effectiveness and meaningfulness of their audits, the\r\n    Audit Department implemented the Audit Information Management System\r\n    (AIMS). AIMS is an end-to-end solution that manages the complete audit\r\n    life cycle of government auditing department.\r\n    It covers various audit-related activities, including the receipt of\r\n    annual financial statements, audit calendar preparation, team formation,\r\n    recording audit observations, generation of audit report and tracking\r\n    findings to closure.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The implementation of AIMS has provided numerous benefits to the Audit Department and its stakeholders:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Streamlined Audit Process: Simplifies the preparation of audit\r\n        notes, audit report, further action reports, and improving efficiency.</li>\r\n\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Generation of Audit Plan and Reports: Quick and detailed\r\n        generation of comprehensive audit plans and reports by saving time and\r\n        resources</li>\r\n\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Efficient Communication and effective Monitoring Mechanism:\r\n        Establishes an efficient communication medium between Auditee\r\n        Institutions and the Department. It also ensures auditee institutions to\r\n        submit their AFS in a timely manner.</li>\r\n\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Timely Reporting: The generation of audit reports, enabling\r\n        auditors to deliver timely reports to auditee institutions. This\r\n        enhances accountability and enables prompt action on identified issues,\r\n        improving overall organizational performance.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Timely Closure of Audit Findings: With real-time tracking, it\r\n        enables auditors to monitor the progress of audit findings and take\r\n        prompt action for timely closure, enhancing accountability and resolving\r\n        issues efficiently.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The implementation of AIMS has revolutionized audit management within\r\n    the Audit Department. The system has successfully addressed the\r\n    challenges faced, by streamlining audit processes, improved efficiency,\r\n    enhanced communication, providing real-time data and insights, improving\r\n    accuracy and consistency.\r\n\r\n    The benefits derived from AIMS have significantly improved the overall\r\n    effectiveness and accountability in the Audit department.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">KRAN Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution\r\n    Provider with an exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector\r\n    verticals in INDIA. Over the past 25 years, the focus has been on the\r\n    Reinvention & Transformation of the client addressing its pain areas\r\n    and specific requirements.\r\n\r\n    With a proven track record, KRAN has successfully worked with\r\n    international agencies like ADB, WHO, World Bank, DFID, etc.,\r\n    implementing prestigious projects in the country. KRAN\'s expertise,\r\n    experience, and commitment to delivering tailored solutions made them\r\n    the ideal partner for the Audit Departments digital transformation\r\n    journey.</p>',NULL),(3,'Public Finance','Enabling Digital Projection of Macroeconomic Indicators: Success story of Assam Directorate of Economics & Statistics','mfp- Case study.jpg',NULL,'2023-08-17','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Directorate of Economics and statistics (DoES) is a nodal agency for\r\n    collection, compilation, analysis of statistics relating to various\r\n    sectors of an economy. The main function of the directorate is to build\r\n    firm and broad data for all plan and policy formulations, which brings\r\n    out the estimates of GSDP/State Income/District Income and the economic\r\n    growth, Capital formation. The mission of the department is to\r\n    streamline and modernise the statistical system to ensure adequacy,\r\n    quality, reliability and timeliness of official statistics..\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Directorate of Economic and Statistics faces limitations in term of\r\n    data availability, timely decision support. The absence of an efficient\r\n    and integrated IT system impacted the department\'s day-to-day\r\n    operations, resulting in delayed decision-making and stakeholder\r\n    dissatisfaction affecting the overall performance of the Department. To\r\n    overcome these challenges and unlock the full potential of DoES, it is\r\n    imperative to implement a modern, automated, and user-friendly software\r\n    solution.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">An end to end open source solution was developed and implemented to\r\n    automate the entire process of Data Collection, Compilation and\r\n    Validation for the Directorate of Economics and Statistics to address\r\n    the challenges faced. Sector wise forms are prepared to capture the\r\n    survey data and in turn this data forms the basis for Macro Fiscal\r\n    Projection. The solution helped in achieving the quality of the Data\r\n    Collection by enforcing its Completeness, Timeliness and Source. The\r\n    data from the field level is captured through the mobile application\r\n    which is then verified by the concerned division heads through the web\r\n    application and approved by the headquarters.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The implementation of the proposed software solution will have a\r\n    significant positive impact on the Directorate of Economics and\r\n    Statistics. Some of the key benefits are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Gathering relevant information from Directorate of Economics\r\n        & Statistics (DES) will help in monitoring the required outcome\r\n        data.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">State/ District wide dashboard regarding the trend analysis /\r\n        forecast for programmes / SDG will help the higher officials to take\r\n        necessary action for successful completion/ closure of the same.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Effective verification process combined with auto alerts on\r\n        major variation of values at regional level, the Quality of Data gets\r\n        improved significantly</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Ensures verified data availability to the public through web\r\n        and social media platforms. Stakeholders can subscribe to receive\r\n        updates on specific data/sectors.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Availability of huge volumes of granular/ regional data makes\r\n        it possible to carry out Data Analytics to help make predictions and\r\n        thereby ensure effective Financial/Scheme Planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In a nutshell, the Implementation of the online system has resulted in the streamlining of the core functions and overall transformation of the Directorate of Economics and Statistics. It has led to timely collection, compilation and consolidation of relevant data from the field. The Collected data can be instantly used for analysis and more accurate fiscal projections. These economic indicators become a valid input for meaningful planning and preparation of the state budget.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">KRAN Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution\r\n    Provider with an exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector\r\n    verticals in INDIA. Over the past 25 years, the focus has been on the\r\n    Reinvention & Transformation of the client addressing its pain areas\r\n    and specific requirements. With a proven track record, KRAN has\r\n    successfully worked with international agencies like ADB, WHO, World\r\n    Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country.\r\n    KRAN\'s expertise, experience, and commitment to delivering tailored\r\n    solutions made them the ideal partner for the Directorate of Economics\r\n    and Statistics digital transformation journey.</p>',NULL),(4,'Licensing and Compliance','Simplified Service Delivery: Facilitating Ease of Doing Business with the Odisha Labour & ESI Department.','0.5877016880709508@-@Labour & ESI- case study.jpg',NULL,'2023-08-16','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Department of Labour and ESI, is dedicated to ensuring compliance\r\n    with labour laws and regulations. With a mission to enhance service\r\n    delivery and efficiency, the department embarked on a digital\r\n    transformation journey by implementing a comprehensive digital platform\r\n    for process re-engineering.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Department of Labour and ESI faced several challenges prior to the\r\n    implementation of the digital platform. A lack of integration, manual\r\n    processes, limited transparency, inadequate public awareness, and\r\n    inefficient document management resulted in inefficiencies, delays,\r\n    errors, and increased administrative workload.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">To address these challenges, the department introduced a unified digital\r\n    platform that integrated services from different divisions. The\r\n    platform facilitated paperless processing, enabling online application\r\n    submissions, processing, and approvals. Real-time communication systems\r\n    kept applicants informed about their application status. Additionally,\r\n    the platform introduced digitally signed certificates, informative\r\n    dashboards, and reports for enhanced efficiency and transparency.\r\n</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The implementation of the digital platform brought remarkable benefits and positive impacts. These included:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Improved Efficiency: Automation of processes reduced manual\r\n        effort and processing time. Accurate fee calculation and online payments\r\n        streamlined operations, eliminating errors and delays.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Enhanced Transparency: Real-time communication provided\r\n        applicants with timely updates, fostering transparency and trust in the\r\n        process. Applicants could easily track the progress of their\r\n        applications.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Convenience for Applicants: Online facilities eliminated the\r\n        need for physical visits, offering convenience and accessibility.\r\n        Applicants could submit applications, provide clarifications, and\r\n        receive notifications from the comfort of their homes.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Time and Cost Savings: By eliminating duplicate certificates\r\n        and reducing paperwork, the digital platform resulted in significant\r\n        time and cost savings for both applicants and the department.\r\n        Administrative workload was reduced, enabling staff to focus on\r\n        higher-value tasks.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Improved Document Management: The platform\'s digital document\r\n        management system ensured efficient storage, retrieval, and management\r\n        of documents. This eliminated the reliance on physical paperwork,\r\n        reducing the risk of loss or damage.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Compliance with Regulatory Timelines: The digital platform\r\n        enabled the department to adhere to regulatory timelines, ensuring\r\n        timely and efficient service delivery. This enhanced the overall\r\n        effectiveness of the department\'s operations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In conclusion, the implementation of the digital platform successfully\r\n    achieved process re-engineering and digital transformation for the\r\n    Department of Labour and ESI. The introduction of a unified digital\r\n    platform, paperless processing, real-time communication, digital\r\n    certificates, and informative dashboards significantly enhanced\r\n    efficiency, transparency, and convenience for both the department and\r\n    applicants. This digital transformation stands as a testament to the\r\n    power of technology in revolutionizing government processes and\r\n    improving service delivery.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">KRAN Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution\r\n    Provider with an exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector\r\n    verticals in INDIA. Over the past 25 years, the focus has been on the\r\n    Reinvention & Transformation of the client addressing its pain areas\r\n    and specific requirements. With a proven track record, KRAN has\r\n    successfully worked with international agencies like ADB, WHO, World\r\n    Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country.\r\n    KRAN\'s expertise, experience, and commitment to delivering tailored\r\n    solutions made them the ideal partner for the Department of Labour and\r\n    ESI\'s digital transformation journey.</p>',NULL),(5,'Public Finance','Entrepreneur Loan Servicing made Easier: Assam Financial Corporation’s Journey to Automation Success ','0.7832462876781389@-@Entrepreneur-Loan-Service-Banner.jpg',NULL,'2023-09-28','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">The Assam\r\n        Financial Corporation (AFC) is a statutory Corporation was established as a\r\n        Joint State Financial Corporation under Section 3(A) of the SFC’s Act 1951. AFC\r\n        has been operating in the North-East Region for more than five decades with the\r\n        objective of offering financial assistance to Micro, Small & Medium scale\r\n        industries within its jurisdiction covering the North Eastern States of Assam,\r\n        Meghalaya, Manipur and Tripura. It a premier Financial Institution(F.I) within\r\n        the North-East Region, it has a wide outreach at the grass root level compared\r\n        to other Financial Institutions(FIs) and Banks.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">The manual\r\n        loan management system significantly impacted the operational efficiency, data\r\n        accuracy, and the ability of the Assam Financial Corporation to meet the needs\r\n        of beneficiaries. From loan disbursement to repayment, recovery and till closure\r\n        was a time-consuming process which slowed down operations and increased the\r\n        work load of the employees before the implementation of a software solution. Manual\r\n        systems often resulted in delays in accessing critical information.\r\n        Decision-makers had to rely on outdated or incomplete data, which hindered\r\n        their ability to make informed and timely decisions.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">To meet the requirements of Assam Financial Corporation, KRAN\r\n    implemented an end-to-end computerization of the corporation’s core functional\r\n    areas. The core loan accounting module effectively monitored all loans\r\n    disbursed by the corporation, maintaining comprehensive records from\r\n    disbursement to repayment, recovery, and closure. This system allows authorized\r\n    users to input data at any stages, eliminating the\r\n    need for manual data entry and reducing the livelihood of errors. It also\r\n    provides instant access for generating reports.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">The\r\n        implementation of the digital platform brought remarkable benefits and positive\r\n        impacts. These included:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n        Improved Efficiency: The automation streamlined the entire loan management process, from disbursement to repayment, recovery, and closure. It significantly reduced the time required for these tasks, making operations more efficient. Beneficiaries experienced quicker loan processing.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Improved Data Accuracy: Eliminated the risk of human errors in calculations and data entry, ensuring that loan accounts and financial records were accurate. This boosted the overall trustworthiness of the corporation\'s financial operations.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Faster Access to Information: Information became readily accessible in real-time. Faster decision-making capabilities and increased transparency throughout the loan lifecycle. </li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Reduced Workload: Automation of loan management reduced the workload on employees. Routine, time-consuming tasks were automated, freeing up staff to focus on more activities.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Enhanced Reporting and Analysis: The software solution enabled the generation of comprehensive reports and in-depth analysis of loan portfolios and financial performance. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In essence, the\r\n    implementation of a software solution for the complete automation of the loan management\r\n    process brought remarkable improvements for both Assam Financial Corporation\r\n    and its beneficiaries. It enhanced the efficiency and effectiveness of the\r\n    Corporation.  Overall, this\r\n    transformation positively impacted the operations of the corporation and its\r\n    ability to meet the needs of its beneficiaries.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">KRAN\r\n        Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution Provider with an\r\n        exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector verticals in INDIA. Over the\r\n        past 25 years, the focus has been on the Reinvention & Transformation of the\r\n        client addressing its pain areas and specific requirements. With a proven track\r\n        record, KRAN has successfully worked with international agencies like ADB, WHO,\r\n        World Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country. </span></p>',NULL),(6,'General Administration','Streamlined Financial Assistance for Women Empowerment: A Successful IT Initiative by KSWDC','KSWDC-banner.jpg',NULL,'2023-09-28','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Kerala\r\n    State Women’s Development Corporation was established on February 22nd,\r\n    1988, with the goal of expanding economic and social opportunities for women in\r\n    the State, particularly those from marginalized and disadvantaged backgrounds.\r\n    The Corporation\'s primary objective is to empower women by assisting them in\r\n    overcoming the obstacles and difficulties that hinder their progress and\r\n    advancement. The support provided by the Corporation has positively impacted\r\n    the lives of numerous women, preparing them to face life\'s challenges.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"> Among\r\n    the various challenges encountered by the Department, a significant one was the\r\n    reliance on manual systems for managing most administrative and functional\r\n    activities within the organization. These manual systems had inherent\r\n    limitations, particularly when it came to scaling operations to serve a larger\r\n    number of beneficiaries.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">After analysing all the requirements,\r\n    we have successfully implemented a web-based solution named “Shesoft” for the\r\n    Kerala State Women’s Development Corporation which automates the core\r\n    functional activities of the Department. The system manages the loan process\r\n    starting right from the loan application till closure with helped in reducing\r\n    the processing time. The implementation of an Integrated Software Solution\r\n    ensured efficient utilization and management of resources.</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The\r\n    implementation of SheSoft has provided numerous benefits for Kerala State Women’s\r\n    Development Corporation and its stakeholders:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n        Improved the speed and accuracy of loan applications and its processing.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Tracks the entire loan disbursed by the organization and have the up-to-date information.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Ensuring greater regulatory compliance, and efficiency enhancement.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Increased the ability to process a larger number of loan applications with limited resources by reducing paperwork. </li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Reduced delays and costs associated with manual processes.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Easily set the limits of loans and other protocols to be followed.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Able to handle multiple types of repayment modes Cash, Cheque, Bank Data Porting etc.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Provides comprehensive reporting, offering detailed financial reports that give a complete overview of the loan portfolio and reinforce decision-making.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Mobile App for the Beneficiaries that helps in Registration, Submission of Application, Viewing the Status of their Application, Viewing the Repayment Schedule and Repayment Status, Loan Repayment etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Facts & Figures</strong></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n        Loan Amount Disbursed till date – 797 Crore rupees.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        No. of loans processed – 25000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">KRAN Consulting Pvt. Ltd. has\r\n    exclusively focused on the Government and Public Sector verticals in India for\r\n    almost three decades. Our expertise in the Loan Management domain and\r\n    implementation experience of similar solution in other States, made us the\r\n    ideal partner for Kerala State Women’s Development Corporation Ltd., to start\r\n    their digital transformation journey. With a focus on Reinvention &\r\n    Transformation of the Department, Kran was able to address the pain areas and\r\n    specific requirements, under the guidance of our inhouse domain experts. We\r\n    also have experience in Grass Root Implementation and Operations of projects in\r\n    Public Sector. Our emphasis on using Open-Source technologies for these large-scale\r\n    projects ensures cost effectiveness, flexibility and easy license management.</p>',NULL),(9,'Public Finance','Simplified Procurement and Logistics Management: Efficient IT Platform of BMSICL','BMSICL.jpg',NULL,'2023-09-28','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Bihar Medical Services & Infrastructure\r\n    Corporation Limited (BMSICL) is set up by the Govt. of Bihar Medical Services &\r\n    Infrastructure Corporation (BMSIC) under the aegis of the Department of Health\r\n    and Family Welfare (DoHFW). Bihar Medical Services & Infrastructure\r\n    Corporation Limited (BMSICL) is incorporated on 26th July 2010 under section\r\n    617 of Indian Company Act 1956 as per the Sankalp cum Memo no. 466(12) Dated\r\n    19.05.2010 of Health Department, Government of Bihar and is responsible for the\r\n    procurement of quality drugs, equipments, services and works for the DoHFW.\r\n    One of the key objectives of the KMSCL is to act as the central procurement\r\n    agency for all essential drugs and equipments for all public healthcare\r\n    institutions (hereinafter referred to as user institutions) under the\r\n    department.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">Before\r\n        implementing the solution, Bihar Medical Services & Infrastructure\r\n        Corporation Limited (BMSICL) encountered several challenges. Managing drug\r\n        procurement, distribution, equipment procurement, and maintenance manually had\r\n        been a challenging and complex process, often fraught with various issues and\r\n        inefficiencies. Relying on these manual processes had caused inefficiencies,\r\n        inaccuracies, compliance risks, and increased operational costs.</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">“BMEDS” – Bihar Medical Equipments\r\n        and Drugs System for BMSICL is a web based solution built on open technologies\r\n        that caters to the core functional automation needs of the organization. The solution\r\n        is work flow enabled wherein users will have different roles and\r\n        responsibilities. The key areas covered are drug procurement, quality check and\r\n        its distribution, equipment procurement, allocation and its maintenance.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The\r\n    implementation of BMEDS has provided\r\n    numerous benefits to the Bihar Medical Services &\r\n    Infrastructure Corporation Limited (BMSICL) and its stakeholders:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Real-time Drug Availability Tracking- State-wide, Warehouse wise, Reorder Level, Safe Stock</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Assess and track the working condition of equipment provided to institutions across the state.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Timely alerts to prevent stock-outs of critical items at any warehouse.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Efficiently match supply to demand reducing excess inventory levels</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Improve flow of materials, products, and knowledge</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Improves system’s responsiveness to the particular customer’s requirements</li>\r\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n        Connects the organizations across locations and improves internal communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">KRAN\r\n        Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution Provider with an\r\n        exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector verticals in INDIA. Over the\r\n        past 25 years, the focus has been on the Reinvention & Transformation of\r\n        the client addressing its pain areas and specific requirements. With a proven\r\n        track record, KRAN has successfully worked with international agencies like ADB,\r\n        WHO, World Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country. </span></p>',NULL),(10,'Licensing and Compliance','Sustainable Compliance Solutions: Pioneering a Digital Revolution in Environmental Governance','PCB- Case study.jpg',NULL,'2023-12-30','KRAN','A','<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">The Kerala State Pollution Control Board (KSPCB) operates as an autonomous body under the Ministry of Environment, dedicated to enforcing laws pertaining to environmental protection. Established as a regulatory authority, the primary mission of the Board is to implement various pollution control laws. Committed to delivering a pollution-free environment to the residents of the state, KSPCB conducts comprehensive studies on underground water, solid waste, and air quality. These studies inform and guide the Board in taking remedial measures to effectively control pollution and ensure the well-being of the people in the region.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Challenges/ Pain Points :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">Before switching to the \'Phoenix\' digital platform, the Pollution Control Board faced issues like Lack of maintaining historical records, latency, duplicate entries, manual processes, verification issues, and limited communication after applications, there were also challenges in handling reports and monitoring due to the absence of a comprehensive dashboard. The information was scattered, there were security concerns, and there was no fully integrated information system.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>The Solution :</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Effectively overcoming challenges, we established a central database for better control over historical records. Our solution ensures data accuracy through checks, simplifies processes, and introduces an intuitive dashboard for real-time insights. We\'ve strengthened security, reduced latency, and streamlined report handling, making it easy to seek assistance. This has built an effective support system within the organization.</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Benefits For The Client :</strong></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">The implementation of the digital platform brought remarkable benefits and positive impacts. These included:</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Improved Record Accuracy: central database guarantees accurate and error-free historical records, ensuring dependable and trustworthy information.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Secure Document Verification: digital signature verification provides a secure and reliable means of validating important documents.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Improved Communication: timely and personalized notifications, with timely updates, fostering transparency and trust in the process.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Simplified Reporting: Automated Reporting improved overall efficiency in submission, generation, and monitoring processes and overall efficiency.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Convenience for Applicants: Online facilities eliminated the need for physical visits, offering convenience, accessibility and Applicants could easily track the progress of their applications.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Empowered Decision Making: comprehensive dashboard offers real-time insights and vital data, making decision-making easy and informed.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Security Safeguards: improved security measures decrease the risk of breaches, keeping sensitive data confidential and protecting against potential threats.</li>\r\n        <li style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n            Compliance with Regulatory Timelines: The digital platform enabled the board to adhere to regulatory timelines, ensuring timely and efficient service delivery. This enhanced the overall effectiveness of the department\'s operations and reducing time and resource constraints.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Why KRAN ?</strong></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%\">KRAN\r\n        Consulting Pvt. Ltd. is an IT consulting and Software Solution Provider with an\r\n        exclusive focus on Government and Public Sector verticals in INDIA. Over the\r\n        past 25 years, the focus has been on the Reinvention & Transformation of the\r\n        client addressing its pain areas and specific requirements. With a proven track\r\n        record, KRAN has successfully worked with international agencies like ADB, WHO,\r\n        World Bank, DFID, etc., implementing prestigious projects in the country. </span></p>',NULL);
