INSERT INTO `submitted_resumes` VALUES (1,NULL,'Karunakaran','karunakaran@kran.co.in',9090909090,'2','Test','0.3948533174944465@-@2024 08 21 JD AL_ML Lead 0.1.docx','2024-10-01 10:19:24'),(2,NULL,'Rohini C','rohinic699@gmail.com',8891013492,'01','Hi Sir,\r\n\r\nI\'m Rohini from Kerala, a dedicated and self-motivated MERN Stack developer with a passion for building robust and scalable web applications. I’m mostly self-taught, and through my learning process, I’ve gained proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, MongoDB, and React.js. I’ve also completed an e-commerce website, which gave me hands-on experience in full-stack development—from designing efficient databases to creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces.\r\n\r\nI\'m good at problem-solving and always eager to learn more, staying updated with the latest tech trends and constantly looking for new challenges. I believe this job opportunity will not only help me further improve my skills but also allow me to contribute positively to your company.','0.9082395721273983@-@ROHINIC.pdf','2024-10-01 18:37:06'),(3,NULL,'Prasmojit Dash ','prasmojitdash@gmail.com',9692648155,'3','Business Analyst having overall experience about 3.2 years. I have worked in different domains like e governance, telecom and insurance sector. Proficient in preparation of BRD,SRS,HLD,LLD,Process flow, Prototyping of application using canva and figma,Release management, software testing etc. Also having knowledge in integration of IFMS in e-governance projects.','0.7221514014153811@-@Prasmojit_CV_BA.docx','2024-10-02 03:14:56'),(4,NULL,'Chandan chetri ','chandanchetry55@gmail.com',8486812602,'1','Skills IT domain with computer networking ','0.003040811314085623@-@chandan_resume_.pdf','2024-10-07 04:05:13'),(5,NULL,'Saurav Mishra','sauravmishra478@gmail.com',9583754345,'5','Having completed my MBA in Marketing and Operations, I am equipped with a solid foundation in marketing principles and strategies. Additionally, I have gained valuable hands-on experience through internships and extracurricular activities, where I honed my skills in developing and implementing marketing campaigns.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, my strong interpersonal and communication skills enable me to effectively engage with stakeholders at all levels. I believe that clear and concise communication is pivotal in building strong relationships with clients and internal teams.\r\n\r\n I have attached my resume for your review, and I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the success of your organization further. I look forward to the possibility of an interview.\r\n','0.46127865208579577@-@Saurav Mishra cv 2.docx','2024-10-10 14:35:28'),(6,NULL,'Vishnu P','vishnu2001p@gmail.com',8304966582,'1 ','Aspiring Software Developer with a strong foundation in Object-Oriented Programming,\r\nspecializing in Java. Proficient in SQL, MySQL, and modern web development frameworks\r\nsuch as, Spring, Spring Boot, Hibernate, and J2EE. Demonstrated experience in full-stack\r\ndevelopment, encompassing both front-end technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and\r\nbackend solutions. Currently pursuing an internship on Full stack Java development course','0.758997522610062@-@VISHNU_P_RESUME.pdf','2024-10-17 16:19:17'),(7,NULL,'Devika S J','devikasj122000@gmail.com',9961160698,'1','I am Devika S J, MCA Graduate. I am writing to express my keen interest in Software Tester position. With a strong foundation in Software Testing methodologies, I am confident in my ability to contribute significantly to your team.\r\n\r\nDuring my academics and training, I have gained a solid understanding of testing techniques, and have experience in creating test plans, executing test cases, and reporting and tracking defects. I am a highly motivated and detail-oriented individual with a strong problem-solving ability. I am confident that my enthusiasm, combined with my technical skills, will make me a valuable asset to your team.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my resume for your review, which provides further details about my qualifications and experiences. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss my candidacy further in an interview.\r\n','0.39372111534196863@-@Devika SJ Resume.pdf','2024-10-18 05:01:39'),(8,NULL,'Ajay murugan R','ajaymuguran321@gmail.com',9344153077,'1','\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMy name is Ajay murugan.I am coming from venkata Puram,I willl complete for master degree ','0.9371950820687917@-@Ajay murugan.resume -1.pdf','2024-10-19 02:34:36'),(9,NULL,'PRADEEP KUMAR SAHOO','spradeepkumar216@gmail.com',7008923629,'2.4','Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n  I am writing to express my interest in the Software Tester role at your company, with 2.4 years of work experience in Quality Assurance and a focus on manual and automated testing, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team. I worked as a QA Analyst at Searching Yard Software Group, where I tested the Healthcare, CRM Domain using my skills. My technical skills include Manual Testing, Automation Testing (Selenium & Python), Postman, SQL, Agile Methodology, JIRA, and J Meter.\r\n   I am passionate about learning new technologies and applying these skills to my job so that I can enhance my skills towards growing in my career. I have mentioned all of my skills and experience in my Resume, which I attached with this application please go through it and discuss how my experience, and skills align with the innovative projects at your company.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my candidacy further.\r\n\r\nYours sincerely,\r\nPradeep Kumar Sahoo\r\nBhubaneswar, Odisha\r\n','0.10523913757700853@-@Pradeep Sahoo.qa.pdf','2024-10-20 08:03:43'),(10,NULL,'Arjun P M Nair','arjunpm.nair@gmail.com',7025577948,'1','I was born and raised in Trivandrum ,now I am in Peroorkada. I graduated from Heera College of Engineering and Technology, affliated to Kerala Technology University. During my graduation period I have done several projects mini and main project. Mini project is IOT recommender for smart parking system, main project is automatic exam hall seating arrangement system.','0.8443101715538006@-@Arjun P M Nair.pdf','2024-10-22 08:30:04'),(11,NULL,'Shamil PP','shamilpp4115@gmail.com',8943155853,'1','Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nWith a passion for developing high-quality mobile applications, I\'m a freelance Flutter developer with an experience of one year. Developed several projects that include Flukefy, Baithulmaal, Product Book, and MyLine, which demonstrate my technical expertise in Flutter, Firebase, MVVM architecture, and REST APIs. I am also keen on bringing my innovative and communicative approach to your team.\r\n\r\nI have attached my CV, which can also be accessed through this link: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wW038rvBM4ugOwt39QgHV0RL9SpveRGi/view?usp=sharing\r\n\r\nI eagerly look forward to discussing how I might best support your team.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nShamil\r\n+91 8943155853\r\nshamilpp4115@gmail.com','0.2583137399051514@-@SHAMIL CV.pdf','2024-10-22 10:15:58'),(12,NULL,'ULLAS HAREENDRAN C','ullaschandroth@gmail.com',9400119346,'8','Project Implementation Engineer 6+years of experience','0.517901199365192@-@Ullas PIE resume.pdf','2024-10-24 16:06:50'),(13,NULL,'Vishwajeet Kumar ','vkv851203@gmail.com',7484019013,'0.1','I completed my B.Tech recently in Electrical Engineering. I have skilled in JavaScript Node js Mongo DB C Git Tailwind Bootstrap Express js and have strong knowledge in C++ and JavaScript ','0.7039653499097371@-@Vishwajeet Kumar.pdf','2024-10-27 13:26:08'),(14,NULL,'Abhijith venu','abhijithvenu25@gmail.com',8848516710,'2.4','I am a python developer with 2 years of experience in python and fastapi, I am an immediate joiner','0.15369847682600157@-@RESUME_ABHIJITHVENU.pdf','2024-10-30 06:00:43'),(15,NULL,'Abhin SV ','abhinsv2001@gmail.com',7592841046,'0.6','Experienced in network administrator linux server administrator windows administrator website hosting ','0.5708445850873219@-@abhin_sv.pdf','2024-10-30 12:55:39'),(16,NULL,'Jayson Das K','jaysondas007@gmail.con',8593834678,'06','Hi, I\'m Jayson Das K, a recent BSc Computer Science graduate and a Flutter Developer. I have experience in building mobile apps using Flutter and Dart. I\'ve worked on projects like Edu Vista Stylish and Drive 2Go  apps, where I used Firebase, APIs, and created advanced UI components. I\'m passionate about mobile app development and eager to learn and grow as a full-stack Flutter developer.','0.9015306612520333@-@Jayson Das K Resume.pdf','2024-10-31 15:14:25'),(17,NULL,'Sanjeev Kumar Das','sanjeev_das74@yahoo.com',8811040450,'24','BE, MBA with 24 years of Business Management Experience: SAAS/PAAS; Govt. Projects in Agritech/ Agribusiness; FMCG & beverages; ICT Solutions, Consumer Electronics & Durables, Mobile Phones & Lifestyle products; Telecommunications; Engineering Projects.\r\n\r\nSenior Business Management Professional with strong business acumen and proven ability to lead and manage business/Projects as a Regional/State Head, lead cross-functional teams, and align them to achieve strategic business goals and objectives within a dynamic and growth-oriented organization. \r\n','0.3227986669330357@-@Resume Sanjeev Das Assam Northeast 01Nov2024.pdf','2024-11-01 14:53:00'),(18,NULL,'Rahul Matta','420206@student.nitandhra.ac.in',8074126595,'0.6','Hello! I am Rahul Matta, a 2024 CSE graduate from NIT Andhra Pradesh. Currently, I am working as a Full Stack Developer Intern and actively seeking a full-time position. \r\n\r\n\r\nWith a solid foundation in programming and a strong passion for technology, I am eager to work with the talented developers at kran consultings. I possess skills such as Python, PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, MySQL, Selenium, ReactJS, AWS, OOP concepts, Java concepts, coding, and strong communication skills. Additionally, I have a strong foundation in the Laravel and Flask frameworks.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am eager to expand my knowledge and expertise by taking on new challenges and learning from experienced professionals at kran consulting.\r\n\r\nHere is the link to my Portfolio: https://rahul420206.github.io/Portfolio/\r\n\r\nEnclosed is my resume for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with the needs of Kran Consulting.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nRahul Matta\r\n+91-8074126595\r\n420206@student.nitandhra.ac.in','0.5091130848254899@-@Rahul_Matta.pdf','2024-11-02 12:00:13'),(19,NULL,'Alka Bhagavaldas K','alkabhagavaldas99@gmail.com',8129011704,'2','I am Alka Bhagavaldas I have been working as an Software Engineer at Poornam InfoVision Pvt ltd for past 2 years and 7months. I \r\npossess a Bachelor of Technology in Information Technology from Calicut University Institute of Engineering and Technology.\r\n\r\nWith 2 year 7 months of experience in server management, Domain management, maintenance, and web hosting ,  I have gained extensive experience in managing servers, troubleshooting domain, website and email issues, automating tasks with scripting. I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.','0.10643841633502726@-@DOC-20240807-WA0004..pdf','2024-11-02 12:50:25'),(20,NULL,'Mohamed Shabeel Ashraf','shabeelash5@gmail.com',9895960030,'1','I am a dedicated and self-driven full stack developer with hands-on experience in Angular, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB. Over the past year, I’ve honed my skills by building scalable web applications, including a full ERP system. I enjoy solving complex problems, constantly learning new technologies, and delivering efficient, high-quality code. Outside of coding, I love exploring new software development trends and staying up-to-date with the latest industry practices. I’m always eager to take on new challenges and continue growing as a developer.','0.5379658606983131@-@Shabeel_Ashraf_MEAN_Stack_Developer.pdf','2024-11-03 10:05:47'),(21,NULL,'Dabriah Monica Joseph ','dabriahmonica1601@gmail.com',9786678706,'1','Myself , Dabriah Monica Joseph.\r\nI\'m from Kanyakumari. As though I recently graduated from BBA at St.Jerome\'s College of Arts & Science. I have attached my resume below. Please feel free to contact me any time for any job openings. Thank you ','0.4329145196830446@-@DABRIAH MONICA JOSEPH (RESUME).pdf','2024-11-04 11:24:30'),(22,NULL,'Anusree Ajay ','anusreeajay2025@gmail.com',8590584074,'1','I am writing to express my interest in the human resource management intern position at KRAN trivandrum. As a BBA final year student at pazhasiraja college wayanad, I am confident that my skills and passion for HRM make me an ideal candidate . My strong communication and team work skills will enable me to contribute effectively to your team.This internship will provide valuable hands-on experience, allowing me to apply theoretical knowledge in a real world setting. \r\nThank you for considering my application.I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further. \r\n','0.464140748773323@-@Anusree Ajay (2).pdf','2024-11-07 06:14:35'),(23,NULL,'Shajith s v','shajithsv1998@gmail.com',7736615509,'2','I am a skilled software testing professional with 1.7 years of experience in manual, functional, API, and automation testing. My expertise includes using testing tools like Cypress and Selenium to ensure high-quality software delivery.','0.9457857811622797@-@Shajith sv.pdf','2024-11-11 06:28:13'),(24,NULL,'Rohini M P','mp.rohini@gmail.com',9496320272,'8','Hello, I\'m Rohini M.P., a seasoned HR professional with over 7 years of experience specializing in Talent Acquisition, IT Recruitment, and Performance Management. My journey in HR has honed my skills in sourcing and recruiting top talent, especially within the IT sector, where I have a strong track record of identifying candidates who align with both the technical requirements and the culture of the organization.\r\n\r\nIn Talent Acquisition, I’m adept at managing end-to-end recruitment processes, from job analysis and sourcing strategies to interviews, selection, and onboarding. My expertise extends to building robust pipelines and networks, which allows me to maintain a proactive recruitment approach that keeps teams agile and well-resourced.\r\n\r\nMy experience in Performance Management is built on creating frameworks that support employee growth and development. I’ve been involved in designing performance appraisal systems, setting key performance indicators, and collaborating with leadership to align individual goals with organizational objectives.\r\n\r\nI’m passionate about using my HR expertise to drive organizational success by optimizing both the talent acquisition process and employee performance, ensuring that the right people are in the right roles and supported to thrive.\r\n\r\nHello, I\'m Rohini M.P., a seasoned HR professional with over 7 years of experience specializing in Talent Acquisition, IT Recruitment, and Performance Management. My journey in HR has honed my skills in sourcing and recruiting top talent, especially within the IT sector, where I have a strong track record of identifying candidates who align with both the technical requirements and the culture of the organization.\r\n\r\nIn Talent Acquisition, I’m adept at managing end-to-end recruitment processes, from job analysis and sourcing strategies to interviews, selection, and onboarding. My expertise extends to building robust pipelines and networks, which allows me to maintain a proactive recruitment approach that keeps teams agile and well-resourced.\r\n\r\nMy experience in Performance Management is built on creating frameworks that support employee growth and development. I’ve been involved in designing performance appraisal systems, setting key performance indicators, and collabo