echnical requirements and the culture of the organization.\r\n\r\nIn Talent Acquisition, I’m adept at managing end-to-end recruitment processes, from job analysis and sourcing strategies to interviews, selection, and onboarding. My expertise extends to building robust pipelines and networks, which allows me to maintain a proactive recruitment approach that keeps teams agile and well-resourced.\r\n\r\nMy experience in Performance Management is built on creating frameworks that support employee growth and development. I’ve been involved in designing performance appraisal systems, setting key performance indicators, and collaborating with leadership to align individual goals with organizational objectives.\r\n\r\nI’m passionate about using my HR expertise to drive organizational success by optimizing both the talent acquisition process and employee performance, ensuring that the right people are in the right roles and supported to thrive.\r\n\r\n','0.9958414089012908@-@HR Resume.docx','2024-11-11 06:43:19'),(25,NULL,'Mrudula Hatkar','himrudula@rediffmail.com',9920358477,'20','20 years of strong work experience in Sales Support specifically in Healthcare, Networking Products and Scientific Products.','0.035987688645795934@-@MRU_PER.pdf','2024-11-15 10:01:46'),(26,NULL,'Abhisuryan R J','abhisuryan@gmail.com',9809552062,'8','Working in a Startup Company under the Kerala Startup Mission whose 90% of business activities in Government Sector. \r\n\r\nI started as Business Development Executive, currently working as a Project Manager. Experience in managing more than 20 projects in Government Sector. ','0.42296926427912496@-@ABHISURYAN Resume.pdf','2024-11-15 20:28:14'),(27,NULL,'Jack Ruben S','jack15ruben@gmail.com',9445433101,'5','Problem Solving: I can assist in troubleshooting technical issues effectively.- Knowledge Database: I have access to a vast database of information, covering the latest trends and solutions in technology.- Technical Guidance: I can provide step-by-step guides and support for various technical tasks or inquiries.- User Education: I can help educate users on best practices and emerging technologies.- Continuous Learning: My abilities are continuously improved as new data is integrated, ensuring that I stay relevant and informative.','0.31243654454777214@-@Jack Ruben S.pdf','2024-11-17 04:42:33'),(28,NULL,'Chinmay bhangale','bhangalechinmay973@gmail.com',9518346522,'1','Ambitious and adaptable graduate with a Bachelor\'s degree in Electronics Engineering. Possessing strong interpersonal skills and a passion for IT Role, I am eager to kickstart my career and contribute positively to a forward-thinking organization.','0.15873203641018163@-@Chinmay_Bhangale__-_Electronics Engineer at Veermata Jijabai Technological Institute (VJTI).pdf','2024-11-17 18:43:13'),(29,NULL,'Muhammed Hashim','hashimmuhammad838@gmail.com',7736463266,'1','Hello, my name is Muhammed Hasim, a passionate Flutter developer with a strong background in creating mobile applications. I have hands-on experience in building apps using Flutter, Dart, and Firebase, with expertise in state management solutions like BLoC, Provider, and GetX.\r\n\r\nI have successfully developed RhythMix, a feature-rich music player app with functionalities such as playlist creation, lyrics display, and seamless playback controls. Additionally, I worked on MovieTix, a movie ticket booking app with real-time data, user authentication, and secure payment integration using Razorpay.\r\n\r\nI am proficient in integrating RESTful APIs, Firebase services, and local databases like Hive. I love solving complex problems and creating user-friendly applications. Currently, I\'m eager to collaborate on innovative projects and contribute to dynamic teams','0.08214699753223409@-@Muhammed Hasim.T- Flutter Developer .pdf.pdf','2024-11-19 10:58:27'),(30,NULL,'AKASH S','akashbinu52043@gmail.com',9345863466,'1','Myself Akash,  I\'m from gudalur I completed my B.E Computers Science and Engi