nd Electronics Engineering from the same institution (2016–2020) with a 7.69 GPA, and I’ve completed a diploma in Bharathanatyam in 2015, showcasing my diverse interests.\r\nMy projects reflect my technical expertise and problem-solving skills: I developed a Matrimony Management System to streamline user registration and profile matching, and a Contract Schedule Management System to automate task assignments with real-time updates. I’m fluent in English and Tamil, and I’m based in Swamiyarmadam, Kanyakumari, Tamil Nadu, India. With a strong commitment to continuous learning and innovation, I thrive in collaborative environments and am always eager to tackle new challenges in front-end development. You can connect with me at +91-8903686404, janisha14041999@gmail.com, or via LinkedIn at www.linkedin.com/in/janishajs.\r\n\r\n','0.4177185762919905@-@J.S.JANISHA (2) (1).pdf','2025-04-11 07:11:36'),(120,NULL,'ADARSH BS','adarshbabu19941107@gmail.com',7510143184,'1','Enthusiastic software tester with a completed software testing course and an internship. And successfully completed academic projects and self-projects like manual and automation testing.','0.7207364652290138@-@Adarsh BS CV .pdf','2025-04-11 11:50:50'),(121,NULL,'CHINMOY KALITA','chinmoyk03@gmail.com',9101385854,'1.2','I have completed mtech degree in Electronics and Communication Engineering.  And I have  experienced on Technical Support role.  I\'m looking for the job on Guwahati,  Assam  location. ','0.7062817147993079@-@Chinmoy_Resume___1_.pdf','2025-04-18 04:08:35'),(122,NULL,'Rajib Borah','rjv.borah@gmail.com',7578026823,'16','Having 16 years of experience in the field of Information technology','0.7515389465857888@-@Resume_Rajib Borah.pdf','2025-04-24 05:50:08'),(123,NULL,'Sanikha','sanikamanoj9065@gmail.com',9072973177,'4','I am writing to show my interest in the position of HR Associate. With a strong passion for Human Resource and a keen interest in fostering a positive workplace culture, I am eager 