ing opportunities where I can contribute my technical skills and grow in a collaborative, innovative environment.\r\n\r\nI’m Abhiram Krishnan R, a Full Stack Developer with hands-on experience in building responsive and scalable web applications using the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, Node.js). I\'ve worked on both company websites and AI-integrated projects, demonstrating my ability to build dynamic user interfaces and robust backend systems. I\'m passionate about applying emerging technologies like AI to solve real-world problems and deliver seamless digital experiences. I\'m currently seeking opportunities where I can contribute my technical skills and grow in a collaborative, innovative environment.\r\n\r\n','0.024024171042046794@-@ABHIRAM-K-R-Resume_2025.pdf','2025-05-18 15:02:36'),(154,NULL,'JISHNU DAS VT','jishnudasvt3@gmail.com',8589068619,'1','I hope this message finds you well. My name is Jishnu Das VT, and I am writing to express my interest in a Python Fullstack Developer/fullstack developer position at Kran Trivandrum. As a passionate and diligent fresher, I have recently completed 6 months PYTHON FULLSTACK DEVELOPER COURSE FROM MASHUPSTACK,TVM equipping me with a good foundation in Python, web development frameworks, and database management.\r\nI am impressed by your company\'s commitment to innovation and excellence in technology. I am eager to contribute my skills to your esteemed organization and learn from the talented team at Kran.','0.8884366317539091@-@JD Updated  Resume.pdf','2025-05-18 15:10:12'),(155,NULL,'Binoy Varghese ','binoyeee2024@gmail.com',9061114206,'1','I’m a  B.Tech graduate in Electrical Engineering with a strong interest in software development, particularly in Python. I’ve focused on building my skills in Python full-stack development, working on projects using Django, Flask, and front-end technologies like HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.','0.2567029226746854@-@inoy_20250114_151113_0000.pdf_20250519_152022_0000.pdf','2025-0