 esteemed organization and learn from the talented team at Kran','0.3166379611234623@-@JD Updated IT Resume.pdf','2025-05-21 15:50:26'),(160,NULL,'AKASH S','akashbinu52043@gmail.com',9345863466,'1','Iam Akash S from gudalur , I have completed my B.E Computer Science and Engineering','0.8488639480272678@-@Akash S (2).pdf','2025-05-21 16:12:30'),(161,NULL,'Femina Shushmi J','feminashushmi2020@gmail.com',9629025190,'1','I\'m a design enthusiast with a background in B.E Computer Science and Engineering, and I recently completed a diploma in UI/UX design. I enjoy solving real-world problems through thoughtful, user-centered design. I\'ve worked on projects like redesigning a resort website using Figma, focusing on improving the user flow and visual clarity. I\'m comfortable with tools like Figma, Adobe XD. I\'m now looking for an opportunity to apply my skills in a real-world environment, learn from experienced designers, and contribute meaningfully to a creative team.','0.3738908842928752@-@resume.pdf (1).pdf','2025-05-23 09:37:53'),(162,NULL,'Jeraldin Jinosha','jeraldinjinosha2000@gmail.com',9385576247,'1','I\'m a passionate Java developer with hands-on experience through internships and academic projects. I have knowledge in Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, MySQL, and basic front-end technologies. I\'m eager to contribute to a professional environment where I can grow as a full stack developer. I\'m available for immediate joining.','0.11704705434960694@-@Jeraldin Jinosha L US.pdf','2025-05-23 11:06:17'),(163,NULL,'HARILAL P','harilalparal@gmail.com',9968470109,'14','Work as a Tender Manager in HYKON INDIA LIMITED, Thrissur, Kerala .\r\n\r\nLooking for a new job in Trivandrum Area ','0.2384332782185271@-@HARILAL P.docx','2025-05-24 07:38:20'),(164,NULL,'Lekshmi S Nair ','laxminair6161@gmail.com',9074326161,'1','I am Lekshmi S Nair currently completed an MBA with a dual specialization in Human Resources and Finance. My academic journey has equipped me with a strong foundation in people management, organizational behavior, and financial planning. I am passionate about aligning HR practices with business goals while maintaining a sound understanding of financial principles. I am eager to apply my knowledge in a dynamic work environment, contribute to organizational growth, and continue learning through practical experiences.','0.578081533046216@-@LAXMI . RESUME HR .pdf','2025-05-24 15:46:51'),(165,NULL,'Abishek A','abimoni2003@gmail.com',8870224305,'0.8',' I am writing to express my interest in Kran Consultancy . With a solid understanding of Development and hands-on experience building applications using HTML,CSS,ReactJs, Java,NodeJs, Expressjs and Sql. I am confident that I can contribute positively to your team while gaining valuable experience in the field.\r\n        In addition to my technical skills, I am a quick learner, adaptable, and eager to tackle challenges. I am particularly excited about this opportunity because I am passionate about the Developer and its potential for building dynamic, scalable web applications. I am eager to contribute to your team, learn from your experienced developers, and help bring your projects to life.I have attached my resume for your review. Kindly consider me for this position. I look forward to hearing a positive response from you.\r\n','0.8600198781565334@-@Abishek-Trainee.pdf','2025-05-26 04:32:56'),(166,NULL,'SIVA PAZHANIVEL RAJAN A ','siva.anbuselvan2015@gmail.com',9489272295,'4.6','I am currently working as an Android Developer with experience in mobile app development, specializing in both Flutter and Android (Java). I am now seeking a role as a Flutter Developer to focus more on cross-platform development. I have published apps developed in both Android and Flutter on the Google Play Store, and I’d be happy to share the links if you\'re interested.','0.5043911304825351@-@SIVAPAZHANIVELRAJAN_RESUME.pdf','2025-05-26 04:55:54'),(167,NULL,'Pravasini Dash','pravasinidash879@gmail.com',9861158248,'1','I am pravasini Dash . Recently completed mca graduation. I am doing many projects in my academic career. Such as E-VOTING SYSTEM, Currency management system etc. i looking for job at your bhubaneswar company. Please any it relates vacancy in your company please mail me . Thank you ','0.2652354234781068@-@Pravasini Dash Profile.pdf','2025-05-26 13:14:07'),(168,NULL,'ADITHYAN PK','adithyankcmh@gmail.com',9495920757,'1','I\'m a passionate UI/UX designer with a \r\nbackground in Computer Science and\r\nhands-on experience in creating\r\nuser-friendly, visually appealing\r\ndigital products. I love turning complex ideas into simple, intuitive interfaces.','0.5713357531384186@-@ADITHYAN_RESUME_2025.pdf','2025-05-26 15:26:28'),(169,NULL,'Jithin Krishna','jithinkrishnaaa@gmail.com',6282418051,'1','Passionate job seeker looking hone my skills by applying it in the industry.','0.7481015020460487@-@Jithin_Krishna_Resume (1).pdf','2025-05-27 09:18:54'),(170,NULL,'Vishnu H','vishnuharidasqwe@gmail.com',7902548677,'2','I am writing to express my interest in the Java Developer position at your company. With hands-on experience in developing scalable web applications using Spring Boot and Vue.js, along with a background in building robust banking software, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\r\n\r\nI’ve attached my resume for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with your company’s goals.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application','0.15623611938219695@-@VishnuHResume.pdf','2025-05-27 12:10:45'),(171,NULL,'Sanjeev Kumar Das','sanjeev_das74@yahoo.com',8811040450,'24','Senior Business Management Professional with extensive expertise in Government consulting and Sales Pursuit Management – Highly apt at leading business operations, project execution/program Implementation for organizations. With a deep understanding of IT solutions sales in the emerging SAAS market, functioning of various Govt. Departments & Agencies and a solid educational background in Engineering and Business Administration, I bring over 24 years of experience/ subject-matter expertise in diverse sectors/domains, including IT solutions, Consumer Electronics, FMCG/ FMCD, Education (ICT Solutions K-12), execution and monitoring of Government projects and capabilities at CXO (C-suite) level relationship building. With excellent communications and documentation skills, I excel in team leadership, strategic planning, Stakeholders Management and Client Relationship Management, driving sales and implementing innovative solutions.','0.1860233520118567@-@Resume_Sanjeev Das_26May\'25.pdf','2025-05-28 04:15:06'),(172,NULL,'Salma N','salmanizar2002@gmail.com',8943156571,'1','My name is Salma N. I am a B.Tech graduate with a strong interest in software development. I recently completed an internship in Java Full Stack Development at Inmakes Infotech, where I gained hands-on experience in technologies such as Java, Spring Boot, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and MySQL. During my internship, I worked on building dynamic web applications and enhanced both my frontend and backend development skills. I am passionate about learning new technologies and committed to continuously improving my skills to contribute effectively in a professional environment.','0.7286804881652815@-@salmaresume_april12.pdf','2025-05-28 13:08:00'),(173,NULL,'AKSHAY KESHAV PHONDKE','akshayphondke33@gmail.com',9004427011,'1','Eager to learn new things ','0.24040522029884404@-@DOC-20240911-WA0005. (1)-2.pdf','2025-05-29 09:57:08'),(174,NULL,'Jishad Ali','jishaddev@gmail.com',6238929131,'1','I\'m Jishad Ali, a self-taught Full Stack Developer with 1.5 years of experience working mainly with the MERN stack – MongoDB, Express, React, and Node.js. I enjoy building web applications that are clean, fast, and user-friendly. I’ve worked on projects like CRM systems and e-commerce platforms, handling both frontend and backend tasks. I’m always open to learning new things, improving my skills, and working with a team where I can grow and contribute.\r\n\r\n','0.8516657351471791@-@JISHADALI-RESUME.pdf','2025-05-29 12:55:53'),(175,NULL,'Alex Zachariah','alexzachariah01@gmail.com',9947359858,'6','I am an detail-oriented and analytical Data Analyst with 3+ years of experience \r\ntransforming complex data into actionable insights to support \r\nbusiness decision-making. Skilled in data cleaning, statistical analysis, \r\nand data visualization using tools such as Excel, SQL, Python, Power BI, \r\nand Tableau. Strong communication and problem-solving skills with \r\nthe ability to work cross-functionally and present findings to both \r\ntechnical and non-technical stakeholders.','0.4836274344034839@-@Alex Zachariah Resume.pdf','2025-06-02 05:59:05'),(176,NULL,'Ramesh','rameshrs7577@gmail.com',9952389114,'3.3','Hi, I’m Ramesh. I have 3.2 years of experience in software testing, primarily in manual and functional testing. I’ve worked on web and mobile applications, handling tasks like test case creation, execution, defect reporting, and regression testing. I worked with Agile methodology and tools like Jira, SoapUI, Postman, JMeter and TestLink. I worked closely with developers to validate features and ensure high-quality software.\r\nAttached resume for your reference.\r\n\r\nThanks and Regards,\r\nRamesh','0.41320688237604875@-@RResume.pdf','2025-06-02 13:52:27');
