gital Inclusion for All: Bridging the Urban-Rural Divide','2025-07-17 15:36:44',NULL),(6,'2025-07-17 15:37:07',' Discusses how structured public data sharing can fuel innovation, foster accountability, and empower citizens to participate in governance.','N','/home/sivanand/cpart/images/1752746827649_case-06.jpg','/home/sivanand/cpart/pdfs/1752746827647_case-study.pdf','2025-07-10','From Data to Decisions: Open Data as a Catalyst for Transparent Governance','2025-07-17 15:37:07',NULL),(7,'2025-07-17 15:37:26',' A policy-oriented whitepaper suggesting governance frameworks for sustainable urban planning, green infrastructure, and community-based climate resilience.','N','/home/sivanand/cpart/images/1752746846889_case-01.jpg','/home/sivanand/cpart/pdfs/1752746846887_case-study.pdf','2025-07-09','Sustainable Public Policy for Climate-Resilient Cities','2025-07-17 15:37:26',NULL),(8,'2025-07-17 15:38:02',' Details frameworks and success stories where citizens directly influence public spending and hold authorities accountable through community-based auditing systems.','N','/home/sivanand/cpart/images/1752746882197_case-02.jpg','/home/sivanand/cpart/pdfs/1752746882196_case-study.pdf','2025-07-01','Social Audits and Participatory Budgeting: Empowering Local Governance','2025-07-17 15:38:02',NULL);
